)s): %(message)s␀Irishi␀Italian␀Jenụwarị␀Japanisi ␀Julaị␀Juun␀Kabyle␀Kannada␀Kazakh␀Khmer␀Korean␀Kyrgyz␀Latvian␀Lithuanian␀Sorbian nke Ala␀Luxembourgish␀Macedonian␀Malayalam␀Data ManagementForm na-efu efu ma ọ bụ a kpara ya aka␀Mmekọrịta otutu-na-otutu␀Marathi␀Maachị␀Mee␀Ozi␀Spanishi ndị Mexico ␀Mọnde␀Mọnde␀Mongolian␀Ihe omuma ndi ozo di na DEBUG = Eziokwu.␀Nepali␀Spanishi ndị Nicaraguan␀Mba␀Mba %(verbose_name)s hụrụ ihe dabara na ajụjụ a␀ %(verbose_name_plural)sadịghị␀Onweghi ụbọchị akọwapụtara␀E nweghị faịlụ e watara␀Onweghi faịlụ a debanyere. Lee ụdị encoding a ntinye na ederede.␀Onweghị ọnwa akọwapụtara␀Onweghi izu akọwapụtara␀Ọ dịghị afọ akọwapụtara␀Bokmål ndị Norway␀Nynorsk ndị Norway ␀Novemba␀Anabataghị ihe odide n'enweghị isi.␀Ọktoba␀Mmekọrịta otu-na-otu␀Usoro␀Ossetici␀PM␀Peeji a a-abụghị “nke ikpeazụ”, a pụghị ịgbanwe ya na int.␀Persian␀Biko dozie data oji abuo a maka %(field)s, nke gha diriri iche.␀Biko dozie data oji abuo a maka %(field)s.␀Biko dozie data oji abuo a maka %(field_name)s nke gha diriri iche maka %(lookup)s n'ime %(date_field)s.␀Biko dozie uru oji abuo nke no n'okpuru.␀Biko nyefee faịlụ a ma ọ bụ tinye akara na igbe akara, ọ bụghị ha abụọ.␀Biko nyefee %d ma ọ bụ fomụ di ole na ole.␀Biko nyefee%d ma ọ bụ fomụ karịrị otu ahụ␀Polishi␀Portuguisi␀Nnukwu nomba nke oma␀Nọmba nke oma␀Obere nọmba nke oma␀Punjabi␀Raw binary data␀Romaniani␀Russiani␀Sat␀Satọdee␀Scottish Gaelici␀Họrọ ezigbo nhọrọ. %(value)sabụghị otu nhọrọ n'ime nke dịnụ.␀Họrọ ezigbo nhọrọ. Nhọrọ a abụghị otu nhọrọ dịnụ.␀Septemba␀Serbiani␀Serbian Latini␀Chinisi Ndị Mfe␀Maapụ Saịtị␀Slovaki␀Sloveniani␀Slug (ruo %(max_length)s)␀Onu ogugu nke obere␀Spanishi␀Faịlụ Nkwụsiri ike␀String (ruo %(max_length)s)␀%(truncated_text)s…␀Ụka␀Mbọsi Uka␀Swahili␀Swedishi␀Nyefee Njikwa␀Tajik␀Tamil␀Tatar␀Telugu␀Ederede␀Thai␀Peeji ahụ enweghị nsonaazụ ọ bụla␀Nọmba peeji ahụ erughị 1␀Nọmba peeji ahụ abụghị onu ogugu␀Uru inline a adabaghị na parent instance.␀Nwụnye ahụ dabara nke ọma! Ị mere nke ọma!␀Onu ogugu ubochi a gha aburiri n’agbata {min_days} na {max_days}.␀O nweghị ihe dị n'ime faịlụ e wetara␀Ebe a enweghị ike ịbụ ohere efu.␀Ebe a enweghị ike ịbụ ihe efu.␀Ebe a kwesiri ekwesi.␀Nke a abaghị adresị IPv6 zuru oke.␀Tọọ␀Tọọzdee␀Oge␀Isiokwu, ntụaka, &amp; otu esi-mee␀Odịnala Chinisi␀Tiu␀Tiuzdee␀Turkishi␀Turkmen␀Nkuzi: App Ntuli Aka␀URL␀Udmurt␀Ukrainiani␀Universally unique identifier␀Ihe N’amaghi␀Bugote foto n’zuru oke. Faịlụ a ị bugoro abụghị foto ma ọ bụ foto rụrụ arụ.␀Sorbian nke Elu␀Urdu␀Uzbeki␀Nọmba %(value)r abụghị ezigbo nhọrọ.␀Uru a ga-abụrịrị JSON n’kwesịrị ekwesị.␀Spanishi ndị Venezuela ␀Vietnamesi␀Lee <a href="https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/%(version)s/releases/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">akwukwo e bipụtara</a> maka Django%(version)s␀Wen␀Wenezdee␀Welsh␀Ee␀I na-ahụ ozi a n'ihi na saịtị HTTPS a chọrọ “Onye isi okwu” ka ihe nchọgharị weebụ gị zitere gị, mana onweghi nke zitere. Achọrọ isi ihe a maka ebumnuche nchekwa, iji jide n’aka na ndị ọzọ anaghị egbochi ihe nchọgharị gị.␀I na-ahụ ozi a n'ihi na saịtị a chọrọ CSRF cookie mgbe ị na-edobe akwụkwọ. Achọrọ cookie a maka ebumnuche nchekwa, iji hụ na ndị ọzọ anaghị egbochi ihe nchọgharị gị.␀I na-ahụ peeji a n'ihi na  <a href="https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/%(version)s/ref/settings/#debug" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DEBUG=True</a> dị na faili setting gị mana ịhazibeghị URL ọ bụla.␀a.m.␀Eprel␀Ọgọ.␀Dis.␀Feb.␀Jenụwarị␀Julaị␀Juun␀Maachị␀Mee␀Nov.␀Ọkt.␀Sep.␀Eprel␀Ọgọọst␀Disemba␀Febrụwarị␀Jenụwarị␀Julaị␀Juun␀Maachị␀Mee␀Novemba␀Ọktoba␀Septemba␀na␀epr␀ọgọ␀dis␀feb␀jen␀jul␀juu␀maa␀mee␀etiti Abalị␀Ehihie␀nov␀ọkt␀ma obu␀p.m.␀sep␀ee, mba, nwere ike␀“%(path)s” a dịghị␀%(pk)sabụghi uru kwesịrị ekwesị␀“%(value)s”abụghị UUID n’kwesịrị ekwesị.␀“%(value)s” uru a nwere usoro nke n'adịghị adị. Ọ ga-abụrịrị n'ụdị YYYY-MM-DD.␀“%(value)s” uru a nwere usoro nke n'adịghị adị. Ọ ga-abụrịrị n'ụdị HH:MM[:ss[.uuuuuu]]usoro.␀“%(value)s” uru a nwere usoro nke n'adịghị adị. Ọ ga-abụrịrị n'ụdị YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM[:ss[.uuuuuu]][TZ] usoro. ␀“%(value)s”uru a nwere usoro nke n'adịghị adị. Ọ ga-abụrịrị n'ụdị [DD] [[HH:]MM:]ss[.uuuuuu]usoro.␀“%(value)s” uru a nwere usoro ziri ezi (HH:MM[:ss[.uuuuuu]]) mana ọ bu oge  n'abaghị uru.␀“%(value)s”uru a nwere usoro ziri ezi (YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM[:ss[.uuuuuu]][TZ])mana ọ bụ ụbọchị n'abaghị uru.␀“%(value)s”uru a nwere usoro ziri ezi (YYYY-MM-DD) mana ọ bụ ụbọchị n'abaghị uru.␀“%(value)s” uru a ga-abụrịrị nọmba ntụpọ.␀“%(value)s”uru a ga-abụrịrị float.␀“%(value)s” uru a ga-abụrịrị onu ogugu␀“%(value)s”uru a ga-abụrịrị na Odighị, Eziokwu ma ọ bụ.Ugha.␀“%(value)s” uru a ga-abụrịrị Eziokwu ma ọ bụ Ugha.␀“%(value)s”uru a ga-abụrịrị Eziokwu, Ugha, ma ọ bụ Onweghị.␀
