"PO-Revision-Date: 2017-09-19 16:41+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: Jannis Leidel <jannis@leidel.info>\n"
"Language-Team: Bosnian (http://www.transifex.com/django/django/language/"
"bs/)\n"
