PO-Revision-Date: 2017-09-23 18:54+0000
Last-Translator: Primož Verdnik <primoz.verdnik@gmail.com>
Language-Team: Slovenian (http://www.transifex.com/django/django/language/sl/)
MIME-Version: 1.0
