␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀%s does not appear to be a urlpattern object␀Bookmarklets␀Documentation␀Documentation bookmarklets␀Documentation for this page␀Filters␀Home␀Jumps you from any page to the documentation for the view that generates that page.␀Model %(model_name)r not found in app %(app_label)r␀Models␀Tags␀Templates␀Views␀all %s␀filter:␀model:␀number of %s␀related `%(app_label)s.%(object_name)s` objects␀tag:␀the related `%(app_label)s.%(data_type)s` object␀view:␀Project-Id-Version: django
