␀␀␀.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀$␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀&␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀5␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀%␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀A user with that username already exists.␀Authentication and Authorization␀Change password: %s␀Designates that this user has all permissions without explicitly assigning them.␀Designates whether the user can log into this admin site.␀Designates whether this user should be treated as active. Unselect this instead of deleting accounts.␀Email␀Enter new password␀Important dates␀Invalid password format or unknown hashing algorithm.␀Logged out␀New password␀New password confirmation␀No password set.␀Old password␀Password␀Password (again)␀Password change␀Password change successful␀Password changed successfully.␀Password confirmation␀Password reset␀Password reset complete␀Password reset on %(site_name)s␀Password reset unsuccessful␀Permissions␀Personal info␀Please enter a correct %(username)s and password. Note that both fields may be case-sensitive.␀Specific permissions for this user.␀The two password fields didn't match.␀This account is inactive.␀Your old password was entered incorrectly. Please enter it again.␀active␀algorithm␀checksum␀codename␀date joined␀email address␀first name␀group␀groups␀hash␀iterations␀last login␀last name␀name␀password␀permission␀permissions␀salt␀staff status␀superuser status␀user␀user permissions␀username␀users␀work factor␀Project-Id-Version: django
