␀Tansa-agi imayl tella yakan.␀Snifel awal uffir: %s␀Yemmal-d d akken aseqdac-agi ɣur-s akk tisirag war ma ttwanefkent-as s wudem aflalay.␀Yettwag  ma yella aseqdac-agi yezmer ad yettwammel d urmid neɣ ala. Kkes afran deg umḍiq n tukksa n umiḍan.␀E-mail␀Sekcem awal n uffir amaynut␀Izemzen ixataren␀Yeffeɣ␀Awal uffir amaynut␀Asentem n wawal uffir amaynut␀Awal uffir aqbuṛ␀Awal n uɛeddi␀Mot de passe (bis)␀Abeddel n wawal uffir␀Asentem n wawal uffir␀Awennez n wawal uffir␀Awennez n wawal uffir yemmed␀Tulsa n wennez n wawal uffir tettwazen␀tulsa n uwennez n wawal uffir tedda␀Tisirag␀Talɣut tudmawant␀Amidan-agi ur yermid ara.␀urmid␀anaw n ugbur␀azemz n ujerred␀tansa imayl␀isem␀agraw␀igrawen␀tuqqna taneggarut␀Isem aneggaru␀isem␀awal uffir␀tasiregt␀tisirag␀addad n unebdal␀tasqamt n wakud␀aseqdac␀tisirag n useqdac␀isem n useqdac␀Iseqdaceniseqdacen␀lqem␀
