correctly. Please enter it again.␀Your password can't be a commonly used password.␀Your password can't be entirely numeric.␀Your password can't be too similar to your other personal information.␀Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d character.␀Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d characters.␀active␀algorithm␀checksum␀codename␀content type␀date joined␀email address␀first name␀group␀groups␀hash␀iterations␀last login␀last name␀memory cost␀name␀parallelism␀password␀permission␀permissions␀salt␀staff status␀superuser status␀time cost␀user␀user permissions␀username␀users␀variety␀version␀work factor␀Project-Id-Version: django
