␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Example: '/about/contact/'. Make sure to have leading and trailing slashes.␀Example: 'flatpages/contact_page.html'. If this isn't provided, the system will use 'flatpages/default.html'.␀If this is checked, only logged-in users will be able to view the page.␀URL␀content␀enable comments␀flat page␀flat pages␀registration required␀template name␀title␀Project-Id-Version: django
