msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: django\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2023-09-18 11:41-0300\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2023-12-04 18:45+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: Jafry Hisham, 2021\n"
