msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: django\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2021-04-07 14:40+0200\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2021-11-27 14:11+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: Soyuzbek Orozbek uulu <soyuzbek196.kg@gmail.com>\n"
