␀␀�␀␀␀J␀␀3␀␀␀/␀␀Y␀␀␀c␀␀&␀␀␀�␀␀4␀␀␀�␀␀C␀␀␀␀␀^␀␀␀]␀␀B␀␀␀�␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀	␀␀␀␀Could not load JSON data.␀Ensure that this range is completely greater than or equal to %(limit_value)s.␀Ensure that this range is completely less than or equal to %(limit_value)s.␀Enter two numbers.␀Enter two valid date/times.␀Enter two valid dates.␀Enter two valid values.␀Enter two whole numbers.␀Input must be a JSON dictionary.␀Item %(nth)s in the array did not validate:␀List contains %(show_value)d item, it should contain no fewer than %(limit_value)d.␀List contains %(show_value)d items, it should contain no fewer than %(limit_value)d.␀List contains %(show_value)d item, it should contain no more than %(limit_value)d.␀List contains %(show_value)d items, it should contain no more than %(limit_value)d.␀Map of strings to strings/nulls␀Nested arrays must have the same length.␀PostgreSQL extensions␀Some keys were missing: %(keys)s␀Some unknown keys were provided: %(keys)s␀The start of the range must not exceed the end of the range.␀The value of “%(key)s” is not a string or null.␀Project-Id-Version: django
